#: src/postulo/plugins/data.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(label)s still holds %(count)d record, and uninstalling it would leave it in a table nothing can read, export or restore. Empty it from the plugin's own pages first, or switch the plugin off instead — off keeps everything."
